*begin allgrind

;for the Grind added 8.5 degrees to compass readings to get true north (so 1 to 2 measured 006)

*equate 	grind.8	darkside.44
*include	grind

*equate 	darkside.1	grindinghalt3.0
*include	darkside

*equate 	grindinghalt3.20	grindinghalt1.21
*include	grindinghalt3

*include	grindinghalt1

*end allgrind
